	keywords = {article; artificial intelligence; biomedical technology assessment; case study; controlled study; diagnosis; diagnostic imaging; forensic medicine; human; Italy; machine learning; health services research; hospital department; hospital management; nonbiological model; organization and management; organizational efficiency; Appointments and Schedules; Artificial Intelligence; Diagnostic Imaging; Efficiency, Organizational; Humans; Models, Organizational; Organizational Case Studies; Surgery Department, Hospital},
