	abstract = {The rapid evolution of technology has transformed education, enabling the creation of innovative e-learning solutions. This project presents a Block chain-Secured, AI-Powered, AR/ VR Enhanced E-Learning Platform, designed to revolutionize the way learners access, interact with, and retain educational content. By integrating advanced technologies, the platform offers a secure, personalized, and immersive learning experience. The platform includes a dual login mechanism, providing distinct roles for administrators and learners. Administrators have comprehensive control over course management, with features to create, edit, update, and delete courses. They can also monitor individual learner progress through detailed analytic, ensuring optimal course delivery and performance tracking. Learners benefit from an AI-powered on-boarding process, which evaluates their interests, skills, and learning preferences through personalized questionnaires. This data is analysed by AI algorithms to recommend courses tailored to each learner's needs, enabling a customized and effective learning journey. To enhance comprehension and engagement, the platform incorporates Augmented Reality (AR) and Virtual Reality (VR) technologies. These tools allow learners to explore complex concepts in an interactive and immersive environment, fostering deeper understanding. Furthermore, gamified quizzes embedded within courses reduce stress, making learning both enjoyable and impact. Upon course completion, the system employs Block-chain technology to generate tamper-proof certificates. These certificates are immutable and easily verifiable, ensuring authenticity and preventing forgery, thus adding credibility and trust to the certification process. Overall, this platform bridges the gap between traditional education and modern technological advancements, setting new standards for secure, interactive, and personalized e-learning experiences. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
