	affiliations = {Atria Institute of Technology, Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Bengaluru, India},
	abstract = {The purpose of the Diet Tracker and Planning System is to assist people in better tracking their eating patterns and reaching their health objectives. This system uses technology like artificial intelligence (AI) and mobile applications to provide personalized nutrition recommendations based on real-time data.It tracks what users eat, analyzes their lifestyle patterns, and offers tailored advice to encourage healthier habits. The system also supports managing chronic conditions by promoting sustainable dietary choices and creating a user-friendly experience through advanced human-computer interaction. By learning from existing studies in areas like gesture recognition, IoT, and database management, this project aims to combine ease of use with powerful functionality. It also addresses challenges like scalability and privacy, ensuring the system is accessible, secure, and adaptable for different users. With its focus on improving community health and supporting sustainable practices, this system could transform how people plan and maintain their diets, making it easier to lead a healthier life. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
