	affiliations = {Kalasalingam Academy of Research and Education, Department of Information Technology, Krishnankoil, India},
	abstract = {AffordaMatch AI is a novel solution that will change the transportation industry. This solution uses dynamic mobility and pricing optimization algorithms to make transportation accessible and affordable. It utilizes artificial intelligence in the system, analyzing real-time data from multiple sources: traffic conditions, demand patterns, vehicle availability, and customer preferences. The platform is moving towards dynamic pricing models by optimizing transportation costs with convenient, affordable, and effective rides. This project fills gaps between affordability and convenience to reduce transportation barriers while diminishing environmental impact and enhancing user quality of life in the city and metropolitan areas This study evaluates the performance of a proposed ride-matching system compared to traditional systems based on key operational metrics. The proposed system significantly outperforms the traditional approach, demonstrating a 60-80% faster ride request processing time (2-5 seconds vs. 10-15 seconds) and achieving 15-25% higher matching accuracy (90-95% vs. 70-80%). Scalability is enhanced, with the proposed system handling 10,000+ requests per minute, double the capacity of traditional systems. Additionally, the transaction failure rate is drastically reduced to less than 1%, representing an 80-90% improvement over the traditional 5-10% failure rate. Driver utilization rates improved by 20-40%, reaching 85-90% compared to 60-70% in traditional systems. The proposed system also mitigates user drop-off rates, achieving 5% or less, a 70-75% reduction from the 15-20% observed in traditional systems. Furthermore, cost optimization efforts yield 15-20% savings, a 10-20% improvement over traditional systems' efficiency. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
